  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The shadow weaver gains an additional spell prepared of each spell level she can cast which must have the darkness or shadow descriptor (indicated with “+1” on the table).</p>\n<p>In addition, the shadow weaver stores one 1st-level spell with the darkness or shadow descriptor in her shadow in addition to the ones described in spell-storing shadow. At every odd-numbered level after 1st, the shadow weaver stores another darkness or shadowUM descriptor spell of any level she can cast in her shadow.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/shadow-weaver#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
